          "message": {
            "text": "Debug mode enabled in settings.\n\nDEBUG = True is hard-coded.\n\nImpact: Verbose errors and the Werkzeug debugger may be exposed if this config reaches production.\n\nExploit scenario: Trigger an exception and read the stack trace / open the debugger console.\n\nPreconditions: Configuration deployed unchanged to a reachable host.\n\nRecommendation: Default DEBUG to False and enable only via environment in local dev.\n\nCWE-489. Severity LOW, confidence medium."
